  "name": "Ritvo Autism Asperger Diagnostic Scale – Revised (RAADS-R)",
  "short_name": null,
  "language": "en",
  "description": "The Ritvo Autism Asperger Diagnostic Scale – Revised (RAADS-R) is an 80-item self-report questionnaire designed to identify autism in adults (18 years or older). Developed by Ritvo et al. (2011) as a revision of the original RAADS, it was created to address the growing need for validated assessment tools specifically designed for adult populations, where autism presentations may differ from those typically seen in childhood.",
